---
// Étape de frise : pastille sur la ligne + carte blanche.
---

<li data-reveal class="relative pl-10 sm:pl-12">
  <span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-[30px] left-[4px] size-4 rounded-full border-[3px] border-primary bg-white"></span>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-card border border-line bg-white p-6 sm:px-8 sm:py-7">
    <slot />
  </div>
</li>
